note Data-parallel fixtures for the Vulkan GLCompute path (gate-vkspirv.sh).
note One invocation computes one element; inputs and outputs are canonical ulong words.
fn vadd a ulong b ulong to ulong
ret add a b
end
note Integer saxpy: signed, so an overflowing row traps (status 101) instead of wrapping.
fn saxpy a long x long y long to long
ret add mul a x y
end
note SplitMix64 finaliser, the element generator for the reduce fixture.
fn mix x ulong to ulong
z = add x 11400714819323198485
z = mul xor z shr z 30 13787848793156543929
z = mul xor z shr z 27 10723151780598845931
ret xor z shr z 31
end
note Reduce stage 1: one invocation sums n generated u32 elements starting at base.
note Stage 2 combines partials pairwise with vadd, one dispatch per tree level.
fn rsum seed ulong base ulong n ulong to ulong
s = ulong 0
for i ulong n
e = and mix add seed add base i 4294967295
s = add s e
end
ret s
end
